flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#ffffff,stroke:#b8babe,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef friction fill:#f6f7f7,stroke:#3a3e44,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef broken fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c4362b,stroke-width:2px,color:#c4362b;
  S1["1. / or Command K or a click on the search field<br/>opens the search over the blurred app, with<br/>recent opens.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. Typing filters by title, address and host,<br/>grouped by folder, the first hit marked.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. Enter opens the marked link in a new tab and<br/>records it for Recently opened.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. No match: 'No matches.'<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. Escape clears the query first, a second Escape<br/>closes the search.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. From the browser address bar:<br/>/search?q=portainer opens the app with that<br/>search.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S7["7. A click on a card opens the link in a new tab;<br/>Command click opens it behind.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S8["8. The Dashboard keeps the pinned row and Recently<br/>opened, else Recently saved.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S9["9. On the phone the search pill opens the same<br/>search as a sheet.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S10["10. Links in a locked folder never show in search.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S11["11. After a very large import, All bookmarks draws<br/>every card at once: 10000 links hold the page<br/>for 1.4 s, 100000 links freeze it for more than<br/>2 minutes. The README promises imports of<br/>470000 links.<br/><i>broken</i>"]:::broken
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> S7
  S7 --> S8
  S8 --> S9
  S9 --> S10
  S10 --> S11
